{
  "description": "std-media-section — content rows that pair copy with a screenshot or illustration: each row has an eyebrow, heading, body text, a short bullet list and an optional link action on one side and its media on the other, and consecutive rows alternate sides. A row without media sits alone at reading width. Stacks on small screens. Pick for 'how it works', product tours and feature-detail pages.",
